# Testing & Dev Server

## RSpec scope

- Trivial/bugfix → only affected specs
- Feature slice → touched layers (model/service/contract/component/request)
- Cross-cutting/auth/tenant → full suite. Use parallel when applicable: `bin/rails parallel:prepare && bin/rails parallel:spec`. Fall back to `bundle exec rspec` only if parallel is unavailable. Do not parallelize a targeted/narrow spec run.
- Never claim tests pass without real command output

## JavaScript (100% Vitest)

- `app/javascript/**` must stay at 100% lines + branches via `npx vitest run --coverage`
- Browser-only geometry may use Playwright + `coverage.exclude` — no fake `v8 ignore` for testable logic

## Dev server

```bash
rm -f public/assets/.manifest.json && SKIP_AUTH=1 bin/rails server -b 0.0.0.0 -p 3000
```

If digested `public/assets/` shadows importmap sources: `bin/rails assets:clobber` then `bin/rails tailwindcss:build`.
